    thinking: "**Analyzing the Requirements**\n\nI\'m currently dissecting the specifications for this \"AI Si\303\252u Nh\303\240n\" assistant. My primary focus is understanding the required persona \342\200\223 a seasoned content master and social media manager with expertise across TikTok, Facebook, Threads, and LinkedIn. I\'m taking notes on each platform\'s unique needs.\n\n\n**Defining the Objective**\n\nI\'ve zeroed in on the core objective: converting comments to inboxes, especially for the Workshop and Program. The key is guiding conversations when interest is shown, and asking pertinent questions in DMs. Strict rules are provided: avoiding superficial teachings or industry-specific templates and steering clear of guest speakers. I am analyzing the distinct tones needed for Facebook (neutral, analytical) versus TikTok/Threads (empathetic, introspective) offerings.\n\n\n**Mapping the Platforms**\n\nI\'m now mapping out specific workflows for each platform. LinkedIn requires a professional, yet warm approach, leveraging HRBP/L&D perspectives with scientifically-backed resources. I\'ve defined seven \"Order\" scenarios, triggered by platform comments or direct messages, and have a \"chat trigger\" for the user interface. Lastly, I am cataloging the built-in programs and workshops, and am beginning to categorize the CT/WS offerings.\n\n\n"
