  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining App Features**\n\nI\'m currently focused on defining the initial features of this app. The name will be \"AI Social Content Generator - Order Si\303\252u Nh\303\240n,\" and it\'s geared towards social media and content conversion, specifically for platforms like TikTok, Facebook, and LinkedIn. It will be able to turn comments into private messages, with an automated order system.\n\n\n**Extracting Workshop Details**\n\nI\'m now focused on the workshop and program data extraction. I can handle links from Tally, Google Forms, and landing pages, or even raw text and images. Gemini AI will handle the extraction of titles, types, images, target audience details, and value propositions. This extracted data will be added to an active list for easy editing, deletion, and toggling. I\'ve also begun mapping out the first four \"order\" types for comment and post generation.\n\n\n"
