  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing the API Server**\n\nI\'m now focused on the backend server build. Specifically, I\'m working on the `server.ts` file. I\'ve defined API routes for health checks and data extraction. The data extraction route, `/api/extract-program`, is designed to parse workshop/program descriptions and extract essential data points like title, type, pain points, and target audience.\n\n\n**Defining Order Execution Logic**\n\nI\'m now diving into the core of the `/api/generate-order` route. This is where the platform-specific constraints and rules come into play, dictating how each order (TikTok, Facebook, Threads, LinkedIn, Email) is executed. I\'m focusing on crafting variations and the 3-step Conversion DM Script generation for each platform. The chat message handling for `/api/chat` is also a priority.\n\n\n"
