  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing The Workbench**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving into building `src/components/GeneratorWorkbench.tsx`. The goal is to make it handle all seven order selections. I\'m also ensuring the automatic platform filter works correctly, particularly for Facebook orders (Orders 2 and 3). In these cases, the workshop dropdown should only display workshops and I\'ll include a clear explanatory notice about the platform restriction.\n\n\n**Defining Output Parameters**\n\nI\'ve been refining the output display. I\'ve decided on including a badge showing the selected program with its core information (values, pain points, and testing angles). I\'ll provide three variations, each with a one-click copy and toast notification. Now I\'m moving on to building out a key output element: the 1-1 Chat Conversion Script. I\'m structuring the script in phases: Empathy & Welcome, and a follow-up discovery question.\n\n\n"
