    thinking: "**Refining Interface Design**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving into the interface design, focusing first on typography. I\'m leaning towards incorporating either `Plus Jakarta Sans` or `Be Vietnam Pro` from Google Fonts to give it a better look. This should really help clean up the visual presentation, I hope it is what you had in mind!\n\n\n**Enhancing Visual Appeal**\n\nI\'ve been working on visual design, and I\'m aiming for subtle glowing backdrop gradients, crisp rounded corners with padding, and glassmorphic cards with a 1px border. I\'m also developing branded aesthetic badges for each platform using their true color identities. To boost usability, I\'m adding quick-action scenario chips in the Studio/Workbench, each instantly populating a realistic scenario when clicked. Finally, I\'m making a live interactive Platform Mock Preview tab for generator output!\n\n\n"
