  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering App Typography**\n\nI\'m currently focused on elevating the app\'s visual appeal and usability. I\'m exploring enhancements that will give the app a world-class feel. My initial consideration is to improve typography. I am considering the Google Font `Plus Jakarta Sans` to bring about an easy-to-read, smart, and sophisticated look.\n\n\n**Refining Aesthetic Details**\n\nI\'ve been further refining the visual aspects. I\'ve integrated \"Be Vietnam Pro\" in `index.html` for superior Vietnamese typography. Also, I\'m working on custom scrollbars, subtle ambient mesh background glow gradients, and glassmorphism with refined borders in `src/index.css`. Finally, I\'ve added a few 1-click presets in `GeneratorWorkbench.tsx` based on smart scenarios, such as \"Tu\341\273\225i 25 loay hoay\", and a button to enhance context.\n\n\n**Expanding Content Capabilities**\n\nI\'ve enhanced the content capabilities, enriching \304\221\341\273\201 b\303\240i contexts with pain points and demographics when clicking \"T\341\273\221i \306\260u \304\221\341\273\201 b\303\240i\". I\'m also adding a \"Tone & Style Fine-Tuner\" for writers to adjust writing styles. I\'m also preparing for a live preview mockup, adding grid view and platform mockups for TikTok, Facebook and Threads content.\n\n\n**Implementing UI Refinements**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the user interface with specific features. I\'m adding a sleek black Threads layout with repost/heart/reply icons, and crafting a professional LinkedIn InMail feed with sender details and connection badges. I\'m also implementing a toast notification system for instant feedback. In the order grid, I\'m integrating platform filter tabs, visual indicator tags for strict rules, and an interactive search bar. Finally, I\'m adding smart quick actions and program cards with statistics in `ProgramManager`. My immediate focus is updating fonts and title in `index.html`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 3
      nanos: 754726397
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
