  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining Workbench Intelligence**\n\nI\'m currently focused on enhancing the `GeneratorWorkbench.tsx` file. My goal is to define what makes this workbench intelligent, user-friendly, and sophisticated. The first key element I\'m exploring is the implementation of \"Interactive Preset Scenarios\" \342\200\223 one-click quick scenarios. I\'m aiming to identify how these interactive presets can improve the tool.\n\n\n**Exploring Scenario Variations**\n\nI\'ve been iterating on preset scenarios, adding more options for users. I\'ve formulated four scenarios related to common workplace and personal challenges: \"Loay hoay 25 tu\341\273\225i, so s\303\241nh \304\221\341\273\223ng trang l\341\273\251a\", \"M\303\242u thu\341\272\253n ng\341\272\247m s\341\272\277p tr\341\272\273 & nh\303\242n s\341\273\261 Gen Z\", \"Ki\341\273\207t s\341\273\251c (Burnout), m\341\272\245t \304\221\341\273\231ng l\341\273\261c \304\221i l\303\240m\", and \"N\303\242ng cao n\304\203ng l\341\273\261c qu\341\272\243n tr\341\273\213 & L\303\243nh \304\221\341\272\241o cho team\". This expansion aims to cover a broader range of user needs and spark more engagement.\n\n\n"
