  planner_response {
    response: "\341\273\250ng d\341\273\245ng \304\221\303\243 \304\221\306\260\341\273\243c c\341\272\255p nh\341\272\255t ho\303\240n ch\341\273\211nh ch\341\272\277 \304\221\341\273\231 **S\303\241ng m\303\240u (Light Mode)** c\303\271ng giao di\341\273\207n tinh g\341\273\215n, t\341\272\255p trung v\303\240 r\303\265 r\303\240ng h\306\241n:\n\n### 1. B\341\272\243n S\303\241ng M\303\240u (Light Mode) & N\303\272t Chuy\341\273\203n \304\220\341\273\225i Nhanh\n- **Giao di\341\273\207n s\303\241ng thanh l\341\273\213ch**: Ph\303\264ng n\341\273\201n tr\341\272\257ng ng\303\240 / x\303\241m s\303\241ng (`bg-slate-50`, `bg-white`), t\306\260\306\241ng ph\341\272\243n cao, ph\303\264ng ch\341\273\257 **Be Vietnam Pro & Plus Jakarta Sans** r\303\265 n\303\251t v\303\240 \303\252m m\341\272\257t khi l\303\240m vi\341\273\207c l\303\242u.\n- **N\303\272t chuy\341\273\203n \304\221\341\273\225i S\303\241ng / T\341\273\221i**: T\303\255ch h\341\273\243p ngay g\303\263c ph\341\272\243i thanh \304\221i\341\273\201u h\306\260\341\273\233ng tr\303\252n c\303\271ng (bi\341\273\203u t\306\260\341\273\243ng M\341\272\267t tr\341\273\235i / M\341\272\267t tr\304\203ng), t\341\273\261 \304\221\341\273\231ng l\306\260u t\303\271y ch\341\273\215n c\341\273\247a b\341\272\241n v\303\240o tr\303\254nh duy\341\273\207t.\n- \304\220\341\273\223ng b\341\273\231 to\303\240n b\341\273\231 c\303\241c khu v\341\273\261c: **Studio Order**, **Kho Workshop / Ch\306\260\306\241ng tr\303\254nh (WS/CT)** v\303\240 **Tr\341\273\243 l\303\275 Chat AI & Th\306\260 vi\341\273\207n Benchmark**.\n\n---\n\n### 2. T\341\273\221i \306\257u Giao Di\341\273\207n G\341\273\215n G\303\240ng & D\341\273\205 Qu\341\272\243n L\303\275 (Gi\341\272\243m R\341\273\221i, T\304\203ng \304\220i\341\273\203m Nh\341\272\245n)\n- **Ph\303\242n c\341\272\245p th\341\273\213 gi\303\241c r\303\265 r\303\240ng**: \n  - Th\341\272\273 Order \304\221ang ch\341\273\215n c\303\263 \304\221i\341\273\203m nh\341\272\245n vi\341\273\201n & n\341\273\201n Indigo trang nh\303\243.\n  - Ph\303\242n lo\341\272\241i r\303\265 r\303\240ng gi\341\273\257a **Workshop (WS - \304\220\306\260\341\273\243c ch\341\272\241y Facebook)** g\341\272\257n nh\303\243n xanh l\341\273\245c v\303\240 **Ch\306\260\306\241ng tr\303\254nh (CT - Kh\303\264ng ch\341\272\241y Facebook)** g\341\272\257n nh\303\243n ch\303\240m.\n- **T\341\272\255p trung v\303\240o h\303\240nh \304\221\341\273\231ng ch\303\255nh**: \n  - Khung nh\341\272\255p th\303\264ng tin / clip tinh g\341\273\215n, h\341\273\227 tr\341\273\243 g\341\273\243i \303\275 nhanh ng\341\273\257 c\341\272\243nh m\341\272\253u ch\341\273\211 v\341\273\233i 1 click.\n  - Khung k\341\272\277t qu\341\272\243 hi\341\273\203n th\341\273\213 ri\303\252ng bi\341\273\207t **3 Ph\306\260\306\241ng \303\241n m\341\272\253u (Hook, Content, CTA)**, **K\341\273\213ch b\341\272\243n nh\341\272\257n tin DM 1-1 (3 b\306\260\341\273\233c)**, v\303\240 **L\303\275 do AI l\341\273\261a ch\341\273\215n WS/CT**.\n  - N\303\272t sao ch\303\251p (Copy) 1 ch\341\272\241m ti\341\273\207n l\341\273\243i cho t\341\273\253ng m\341\272\253u.\n\n---\n\n### 3. V\341\273\201 Model AI S\341\273\255 D\341\273\245ng\n- H\341\273\207 th\341\273\221ng \304\221ang ch\341\272\241y tr\341\273\261c ti\341\272\277p tr\303\252n **`gemini-3.7-flash`** \342\200\223 d\303\262ng m\303\264 h\303\254nh th\341\272\277 h\341\273\207 m\341\273\233i nh\341\272\245t c\341\273\247a Google v\341\273\233i t\341\273\221c \304\221\341\273\231 x\341\273\255 l\303\275 nhanh v\306\260\341\273\243t tr\341\273\231i, kh\341\272\243 n\304\203ng t\306\260 duy logic v\303\240 chuy\341\273\203n \304\221\341\273\225i insight s\303\242u s\341\272\257c, \304\221\341\273\223ng th\341\273\235i t\341\273\221i \306\260u chi ph\303\255 v\303\240 thu\341\273\231c g\303\263i s\341\273\255 d\341\273\245ng hi\341\273\207u n\304\203ng cao nh\341\272\245t."
    thinking: "**Reviewing User Requests**\n\nAlright, the build and lint are done, so I\'ve shifted focus to user requests. I\'ve successfully implemented light mode as the default, complete with a toggle on the top bar. Addressing the \"t\" request, I\'m now working on translation options. Next, I plan to delve into a full feature review for accessibility concerns.\n\n\n"
