\240n h\303\254nh nh\303\251:\n\n\360\237\223\213 **DANH S\303\201CH ORDER T\341\273\260 \304\220\341\273\230NG:**\n- **Order 1**: Comment qua clip TikTok (\304\220\341\273\223ng c\341\272\243m tu\341\273\225i 20-39, t\341\272\267ng b\303\240i test 1-1)\n- **Order 2**: Comment qua post Facebook (*Ch\341\273\211 Workshop (WS), tone trung l\341\272\255p ph\303\242n t\303\255ch hai chi\341\273\201u)\n- **Order 3**: Vi\341\272\277t b\303\240i Facebook (*Ch\341\273\211 Workshop (WS), ph\303\242n t\303\255ch s\303\242u s\341\272\257c, h\341\273\217i link)\n- **Order 4**: Comment Threads (T\341\273\261 s\341\273\261, ch\303\242n th\341\272\255t, ch\341\272\241m n\341\273\227i \304\221au n\341\273\231i t\303\242m)\n- **Order 5**: Vi\341\272\277t b\303\240i Threads (Ng\341\272\257n g\341\273\215n, hook b\341\272\257t tai, ng\341\272\257t d\303\262ng nh\341\273\213p nh\303\240ng)\n- **Order 6**: Vi\341\272\277t b\303\240i ti\341\272\277p c\341\272\255n qua tin nh\341\272\257n LinkedIn (G\303\263c nh\303\254n HRBP/L&D, MBTI & n\304\203ng l\306\260\341\273\243ng)\n- **Order 7**: Vi\341\272\277t content Email (Ti\303\252u \304\221\341\273\201 t\303\262 m\303\262, c\303\242u chuy\341\273\207n k\341\272\277t n\341\273\221i, c\303\242u h\341\273\217i t\341\273\261 v\341\272\245n)\n\n\360\237\221\211 *B\341\272\241n mu\341\273\221n th\341\273\261c hi\341\273\207n Order n\303\240o ngay b\303\242y gi\341\273\235? H\303\243y g\303\265 v\303\255 d\341\273\245: \"Order 1 [m\303\264 t\341\272\243 clip]\" ho\341\272\267c b\341\272\245m n\303\272t Order b\303\252n d\306\260\341\273\233i.*`;\n\n      return res.json({\n        success: true,\n        reply: orderMenuText,\n        suggestedActions: [\n          { label: \'\360\237\216\254 Order 1: Comment TikTok\', action: \'Order 1\', orderType: \'order_1\' },\n          { label: \'\360\237\222\254 Order 2: Comment Facebook\', action: \'Order 2\', orderType: \'order_2\' },\n          { label: \'\360\237\223\235 Order 3: B\303\240i vi\341\27